        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nicole Morier, Selena Gomez, Madonna, Patrick Leonard, Destinee & Paris\n- Songs: \"Rock Me In\", \"Whiplash\", \"La Isla Bonita\"\n- Topics: songwriting, Latin pop influence, musical influence\n\nFacts:\n- Nicole Morier co-wrote \"Rock Me In\" with a singer.\n- Nicole Morier co-wrote \"Whiplash\" for Selena Gomez & the Scene with the same singer.\n- The same singer and Nicole Morier also wrote one other song.\n- That other song has a Latin pop influence similar to Madonna's \"La Isla Bonita\".\n- Madonna co-wrote and co-produced \"La Isla Bonita\" with Patrick Leonard.\n- Destinee & Paris cited the singer as an influence.",
